<title>SINGAPORE: Winfoong buys more Hong Fok.</title>
<headline>Winfoong buys more Hong Fok.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong's Winfoong Holding Ltd has bought an additional 1.126 million shares in Hong Fok Corp, a Hong Fok statement said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Winfoong bought the shares in the open market at an average price of Singapore $2.78525 on April 21, 1997.</p>
<p>After the purchase, Winfoong held 6.29 percent or 8.58 million Hong Fok shares.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
